1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:29,980
To be continued...

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,020
I was fine up until then.

3
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,900
You treated those tryouts like a get-along club.

4
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,600
I couldn't focus because you wanted to goof off.

5
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,740
I would have passed if it wasn't for you.

6
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,760
Uh, what on earth is he talking about?

7
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:51,080
How did talentless losers like you make it into a Spirion?

8
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:51,520
Kaneda!

9
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,440
Stop it.

10
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:56,000
You didn't make the team because you weren't good enough.

11
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,560
Quit trying to blame everyone else for your screw-ups.

12
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,640
Tachibana.

13
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:06,280
At least I've scored seven goals as a forward in the Tokyo Metropolis League.

14
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:13,200
Word on the street is that you haven't scored a single goal, even though you've played in every game.

15
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:14,940
How unfortunate.

16
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:19,820
It must be hard trying to fit into a strong club, one you don't deserve to be in.

17
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:22,520
I bet you're regretting it now, aren't you?

18
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:23,920
Well?

19
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,220
Oh.

20
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:28,500
I guess so you're, at least, while you're up in this, I think.

21
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:29,160
It wasn't because of me.

22
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,480
Bye.

23
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,060
I'm feeling bad for you.

24
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:30,880
Bye.

25
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:30,920
Oh!

26
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:32,880
Bye.

