Bye.

50
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,520
Bye.

51
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:46,100
Cachibana.

52
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:46,360
Bye.

53
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:47,020
Bye.

54
